    <comment>New package python-sglang 0.5.17 (devel: science:machinelearning). CPU singlespec (python313), alts for the sglang CLI. pluskalm is the science:machinelearning/python-sglang package maintainer.

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS — please stage together:
* sr#1372971 python-blobfile
* sr#1372972 python-easydict
* sr#1372973 python-timm 1.0.16
* sr#1372976 python-torchao 0.17.0
* sr#1372989 python-gguf
* sr#1372990 python-modelscope-hub
* sr#1372992 python-modelscope

