* GitHub v0.5.17 tag (PyPI ships wheels only)
* Add sglang-relax-cpu-requirements.patch: relax
transformers/openai/xgrammar, drop unpackaged
CPU-inappropriate deps
* Add sglang-cpu-triton-stub.patch
* Build Rust PyO3 extensions (multimodal, grpc)
* Add sglang-cpu-rust-exts.patch
* Add sglang-grpc-system-protoc.patch
* Add vendor.tar.zst
* CARGO_HOME vendor remap (setuptools-rust runs from python/)
* sglang-server not built: dynamo-protocols 5.3.1 added
ChatCompletionTokenLogprob.token_id
* libalternatives (alts) for the sglang CLI</comment>
